  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Collapsing Stars**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Here I Am**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Mosquito Repellent**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Suedehead**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Supergenesis**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Thank You Mario But Our Princess Is In Another Castle [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mountaingoats2008-11-03.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 84 min [1]. Said about its sound: Audience recording is crisp and clear overall, though nearby talkers, noise and loud clapping intrude; still very listenable; The uploader applied some compression to the crowd cheering and applause [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Kaki King guested on some songs, singing co-vocals on certain numbers and playing guitar on others [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mountaingoats2008-11-03.flac16**: taped by ezralite23; transferred by ezralite23; source: Sony ECM-DS70P > SPSB-11 Batt Box > Sony MZ-M200 [1]",
